<span class=\"cat\">全球</span></span><time datetime=\"2026-11-23T03:10:12+08:00\">03:10</time></div><h2 class=\"card__title\"><a href=\"https://t.me/pelosi3/30392\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">特朗普：如果无法达成协议，倾向于新年后打击伊朗</a></h2><p class=\"card__body\">据福克斯新闻，美国总统特朗普称，如果无法达成协议，他倾向于在新年之后恢复对伊朗的战争。他说：“美国与伊朗仍在进行间接谈判，但尚未取得实质性成果。伊朗人不停地说，却是欺骗和拖延的高手。”他还表示，任何试图突破封锁的伊朗船只，都将落得与伊朗其他海军力量一样的下场——沉入海底。</p><div class=\"card__actions\"><button class=\"g-btn g-btn--text expand\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span>展开全文</span><svg class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"#t-chevron-down\"/></svg></button><a class=\"g-btn g-btn--text\" href=\"https://t.me/pelosi3/30392\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>阅读原文</span><svg class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"#t-external-link\"/></svg></a><button class=\"icon-btn bookmark\" type=\"button\" data-bookmark=\"{&quot;id&quot;: &quot;17ad5d139cbb559530666df124d4b968a733050eb6044aa1f45d34d5d0535e82&quot;, &quot;title&quot;: &quot;特朗普：如果无法达成协议，倾向于新年后打击伊朗&quot;, &quot;url&quot;: &quot;https://t.me/pelosi3/30392&quot;, &quot;source&quot;: &quot;敏感经济信息分享&quot;, &quot;time&quot;: &quot;2026-11-23T03:10:12+08:00&quot;, &quot;snippet&quot;: &quot;据福克斯新闻，美国总统特朗普称，如果无法达成协议，他倾向于在新年之后恢复对伊朗的战争。他说：“美国与伊朗仍在进行间接谈判，但尚未取得实质性成果。伊朗人不停地说，却是欺骗和拖延的高手。”他还表示，任何试图突破封锁的伊朗船只，都将落得与伊朗其他海军力量一样的下场——沉入海底。&quot;}\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-label=\"收藏\"><span class=\"ph-bookmark\"><svg class=\"phosphor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M184,32H72A16,16,0,0,0,56,48V224a8,8,0,0,0,12.24,6.78L128,193.43l59.77,37.35A8,8,0,0,0,200,224V48A16,16,0,0,0,184,32Zm0,177.57-51.77-32.35a8,8,0,0,0-8.48,0L72,209.57V48H184Z\"/></svg><svg class=\"phosphor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M184,32H72A16,16,0,0,0,56,48V224a8,8,0,0,0,12.24,6.78L128,193.43l59.77,37.35A8,8,0,0,0,200,224V48A16,16,0,0,0,184,32Z\"/></svg></span></button></div></article>","moment":"2026-11-23T03:10:12+08:00","precision":"instant","raw_time":"2026-11-23T03:10:12+08:00","source":"pelosi3","topic":"国际","uid":"17ad5d139cbb559530666df124d4b968a733050eb6044aa1f45d34d5d0535e82"},{"alias":"CE_Observe","day":"2026-11-23","html":"<article class=\"g-card card news card--text\" data-cat=\"财经\" data-ch=\"CE_Observe\"><div class=\"g-card__label\"><span class=\"g-card__who\"><span class=\"source\" data-source=\"CE_Observe\">每日消费电子观察</span><span class=\"cat\">财经</span></span><time datetime=\"2026-11-23T02:07:22+08:00\">02:07</time></div><h2 class=\"card__title\"><a href=\"https://t.me/CE_Observe/44761\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">R星称GTA6地图已经为未来更新预留空间 部分地点可能用于后续内容</a></h2><p class=\"card__body\">游戏网站 Kotaku 编辑表示，自己在 GTA6 中游玩超过 130 小时后，发现仍有部分地点没有在主线剧情中到访，包括动物园和北部的小镇。这名编辑还注意到，地图上至少有两座大型赌场但玩家无法进入，在主线和支线任务中这些赌场也没有被提及或作为任务地点。\n\n斯蒂芬唐金解释称，R 星认为在杰森和露西亚的故事中添加赌场玩法并不合适，尤其需要考虑游戏经济系统的平衡，所以现阶段赌场等确实没有添加到任务中。</p><div class=\"card__actions\"><button class=\"g-btn g-btn--text expand\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span>展开全文</span><svg class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"#t-chevron-down\"/></svg></button><a class=\"g-btn g-btn--text\" href=\"https://t.me/CE_Observe/44761\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>阅读原文</span><svg class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"#t-external-link\"/></svg></a><button class=\"icon-btn bookmark\" type=\"button\" data-bookmark=\"{&quot;id&quot;: &quot;ce9e3dfea2875205cd4aa8dff35a49eea8d0023fbf522b3a697913a4eb560074&quot;, &quot;title&quot;: &quot;R星称GTA6地图已经为未来更新预留空间 部分地点可能用于后续内容&quot;, &quot;url&quot;: &quot;https://t.me/CE_Observe/44761&quot;, &quot;source&quot;: &quot;每日消费电子观察&quot;, &quot;time&quot;: &quot;2026-11-23T02:07:22+08:00&quot;, &quot;snippet&quot;: &quot;游戏网站 Kotaku 编辑表示，自己在 GTA6 中游玩超过 130 小时后，发现仍有部分地点没有在主线剧情中到访，包括动物园和北部的小镇。这名编辑还注意到，地图上至少有两座大型赌场但玩家无法进入，在主线和支线任务中这些赌场也没有被提及或作为任务地点。\\n\\n斯蒂芬唐金解释称，R 星认为在杰森和露西亚的故事中添加赌场玩法并不合适，尤其需要考虑游戏经济系统的平衡，所以现阶段赌场等确实没有添加到任务中。&quot;}\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-label=\"收藏\"><span class=\"ph-bookmark\"><svg class=\"phosphor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M184,32H72A16,16,0,0,0,56,48V224a8,8,0,0,0,12.24,6.78L128,193.43l59.77,37.35A8,8,0,0,0,200,224V48A16,16,0,0,0,184,32Zm0,177.57-51.77-32.35a8,8,0,0,0-8.48,0L72,209.57V48H184Z\"/></svg><svg class=\"phosphor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M184,32H72A16,16,0,0,0,56,48V224a8,8,0,0,0,12.24,6.78L128,193.43l59.77,37.35A8,8,0,0,0,200,224V48A16,16,0,0,0,184,32Z\"/></svg></span></button></div></article>","moment":"2026-11-23T02:07:22+08:00","precision":"instant","raw_time":"2026-11-23T02:07:22+08:00","source":"CE_Observe","topic":"财经","uid":"ce9e3dfea2875205cd4aa8dff35a49eea8d0023fbf522b3a697913a4eb560074"},{"alias":"CE_Observe","day":"2026-11-23","html":"<article class=\"g-card card news card--text\" data-cat=\"科技\" data-ch=\"CE_Observe\"><div class=\"g-card__label\"><span class=\"g-card__who\"><span class=\"source\" data-source=\"CE_Observe\">每日消费电子观察</span><span class=\"cat\">科技</span></span><time datetime=\"2026-11-23T02:06:35+08:00\">02:06</time></div><h2 class=\"card__title\"><a href=\"https://t.me/CE_Observe/44760\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">谷歌公布安卓侧载安装验证的时间表 9月底开始四国用户侧载APK将受限制</a></h2><p class=\"card__body\">最后到 2027 年安卓开发者验证将会覆盖到全球范围，到时候所有支持 GMS 的设备默认侧载安装时，都必须安装经过开发者身份验证的应用程序，未经身份认证的应用程序会被系统直接拦截，用户要么等待开启免验证等待 24 小时，要么通过 ADB 执行操作。</p><div class=\"card__actions\"><button class=\"g-btn g-btn--text expand\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span>展开全文</span><svg class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"#t-chevron-down\"/></svg></button><a class=\"g-btn g-btn--text\" href=\"https://t.me/CE_Observe/44760\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>阅读原文</span><svg class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"#t-external-link\"/></svg></a><button class=\"icon-btn bookmark\" type=\"button\" data-bookmark=\"{&quot;id&quot;: &quot;4ead3098396b1c210ebfad540d8687605625f3e0991e7acde4af4b95ed33f5bd&quot;, &quot;title&quot;: &quot;谷歌公布安卓侧载安装验证的时间表 9月底开始四国用户侧载APK将受限制&quot;, &quot;url&quot;: &quot;https://t.me/CE_Observe/44760&quot;, &quot;source&quot;: &quot;每日消费电子观察&quot;, &quot;time&quot;: &quot;2026-11-23T02:06:35+08:00&quot;, &quot;snippet&quot;: &quot;最后到 2027 年安卓开发者验证将会覆盖到全球范围，到时候所有支持 GMS 的设备默认侧载安装时，都必须安装经过开发者身份验证的应用程序，未经身份认证的应用程序会被系统直接拦截，用户要么等待开启免验证等待 24 小时，要么通过 ADB 执行操作。&quot;}\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-label=\"收藏\"><span class=\"ph-bookmark\"><svg class=\"phosphor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M184,32H72A16,16,0,0,0,56,48V224a8,8,0,0,0,12.24,6.78L128,193.43l59.77,37.35A8,8,0,0,0,200,224V48A16,16,0,0,0,184,32Zm0,177.57-51.77-32.35a8,8,0,0,0-8.48,0L72,209.57V48H184Z\"/></svg><svg class=\"phosphor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M184,32H72A16,16,0,0,0,56,48V224a8,8,0,0,0,12.24,6.78L128,193.43l59.77,37.35A8,8,0,0,0,200,224V48A16,16,0,0,0,184,32Z\"/></svg></span></button></div></article>","moment":"2026-11-23T02:06:35+08:00","precision":"instant","raw_time":"2026-11-23T02:06:35+08:00","source":"CE_Observe","topic":"科技","uid":"4ead3098396b1c210ebfad540d8687605625f3e0991e7acde4af4b95ed33f5bd"},{"alias":"tnews365","day":"2026-11-23","html":"<article class=\"g-card card news card--text\" data-cat=\"全球\" data-ch=\"tnews365\"><div class=\"g-card__label\"><span class=\"g-card__who\"><span class=\"source\" data-source=\"tnews365\">竹新社</span><span class=\"cat\">全球</span></span><time datetime=\"2026-11-23T00:49:19+08:00\">00:49</time></div><h2 class=\"card__title\"><a href=\"https://t.me/tnews365/35804\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">印度尼西亚警方11月22日晚表示，万丹省21日晚发生火灾的糖果厂整理出24个尸袋，另有约30人失联</a></h2><p class=\"card__body\">火仍未被完全扑灭，搜救工作计划23日上午恢复。由于厂房部分结构仍存在坍塌风险，加之现场仍有余火，救援工作面临困难。\n工厂方面称，事发时共有约300人在场。目前，火灾原因仍在调查中。\n（路透社，新华社）</p><div class=\"card__actions\"><button class=\"g-btn g-btn--text expand\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><span>展开全文</span><svg class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"#t-chevron-down\"/></svg></button><a class=\"g-btn g-btn--text\" href=\"https://t.me/tnews365/35804\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>阅读原文</span><svg class=\"i\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use href=\"#t-external-link\"/></svg></a><button class=\"icon-btn bookmark\" type=\"button\" data-bookmark=\"{&quot;id&quot;: &quot;61de57eddb18e7d7a2f580c199bf86c73fc14f2a09b41c95187e5e465cc999ce&quot;, &quot;title&quot;: &quot;印度尼西亚警方11月22日晚表示，万丹省21日晚发生火灾的糖果厂整理出24个尸袋，另有约30人失联&quot;, &quot;url&quot;: &quot;https://t.me/tnews365/35804&quot;, &quot;source&quot;: &quot;竹新社&quot;, &quot;time&quot;: &quot;2026-11-23T00:49:19+08:00&quot;, &quot;snippet&quot;: &quot;火仍未被完全扑灭，搜救工作计划23日上午恢复。由于厂房部分结构仍存在坍塌风险，加之现场仍有余火，救援工作面临困难。\\n工厂方面称，事发时共有约300人在场。目前，火灾原因仍在调查中。\\n（路透社，新华社）&quot;}\" aria-pressed=\"false\" aria-label=\"收藏\"><span class=\"ph-bookmark\"><svg class=\"phosphor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M184,32H72A16,16,0,0,0,56,48V224a8,8,0,0,0,12.24,6.78L128,193.43l59.77,37.35A8,8,0,0,0,200,224V48A16,16,0,0,0,184,32Zm0,177.57-51.77-32.35a8,8,0,0,0-8.48,0L72,209.57V48H184Z\"/></svg><svg class=\"phosphor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" fill=\"currentColor\"><path d=\"M184,32H72A16,16,0,0,0,56,48V224a8,8,0,0,0,12.24,6.78L128,193.43l59.77,37.35A8,8,0,0,0,200,224V48A16,16,0,0,0,184,32Z\"/></svg></span></button></div></article>","moment":"2026-11-23T00:49:19+08:00","prec